    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"greater good\" sounds a bit more like a moral argument than a financial one. if i'm managing a fund, i need to know if the math actually works. if the cost of minerals keeps rising and the grid can't handle the intermittency, the \"strategic move\" could end up being a massive loss for investors. are you saying the economic downsides are just secondary to the climate goals?",
